---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="匹克球新手裝備推薦｜60 秒配好第一套裝備｜PickleStart Taiwan"
  description="第一次打匹克球不知道要買什麼？回答 6 題，依經驗、場地、已有裝備與預算，整理你的匹克球新手裝備建議，告訴你哪些現在買、哪些可以沿用或先不用買。"
>
  <section class="hero-v3">
    <div class="hero-v3-copy">
      <p class="scribble-kicker">New Game, Brighter You.</p>

      <h1 class="hero-title-v4">
        <span class="hero-title-line hero-title-dark">第一次打匹克球？</span>
        <span class="hero-title-line hero-title-teal">60 秒配好你的</span>
        <span class="hero-title-line hero-title-teal">第一套裝備</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="hero-v3-lead">
        依你的經驗、場地、現有裝備與預算，只推薦真正需要的。
      </p>

      <p class="hero-intent-label">你想先做什麼？</p>

      <div class="hero-intent-grid">
        <a
          class="hero-intent-card hero-intent-builder"
          href="/builder?from=home_hero"
          data-home-event="homepage_builder_clicked"
          data-home-placement="hero"
        >
          <span class="hero-intent-kicker">READY TO PLAY</span>
          <strong>我想開始玩</strong>
          <small>回答 6 題，60 秒配好第一套裝備</small>
          <b>幫我配第一套裝備 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></b>
        </a>

        <a
          class="hero-intent-card hero-intent-learn"
          href="/guide/what-is-pickleball"
          data-home-event="homepage_beginner_guide_clicked"
          data-home-placement="hero"
        >
          <span class="hero-intent-kicker">NEW TO PICKLEBALL</span>
          <strong>我還不太熟</strong>
          <small>先花 5 分鐘搞懂規則、場地與常見術語</small>
          <b>先看新手入門 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></b>
        </a>
      </div>

      <p class="hero-method-link">
        想知道推薦是怎麼算的？
        <a
          href="/how-we-recommend"
          data-home-event="homepage_recommendation_method_clicked"
          data-home-placement="hero"
        >
          查看推薦方式 →
        </a>
      </p>

      <div class="hero-proof">
        <span>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 2 4 14h7l-1 8 10-13h-7z"/></svg>
          免費使用
        </span>
        <span>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 11a4 4 0 1 0 0-8 4 4 0 0 0 0 8Zm8-1a3 3 0 1 0 0-6 3 3 0 0 0 0 6ZM2 21v-3c0-3 2.7-5 6-5s6 2 6 5v3H2Zm13 0v-3c0-1.6-.6-3-1.6-4 3.7-.5 6.6 1.3 6.6 4v3h-5Z"/></svg>
          不需註冊
        </span>
        <span>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16v3H4V5Zm0 6h16v3H4v-3Zm0 6h16v3H4v-3Z"/></svg>
          只要 6 題
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-v3-visual">
      <img
        class="hero-court-photo"
        src="/images/hero-pickleball.webp"
        alt="戶外匹克球場上正在比賽的玩家，前景有球拍與黃色匹克球"
      />

      <div class="hero-photo-wash"></div>

      <aside class="starter-preview-card starter-preview-v3 preview-compact">
        <div class="preview-heading preview-heading-v4">
          <div>
            <small>結果預覽</small>
            <strong>完成後你會看到</strong>
          </div>
          <span class="preview-ready">60 秒</span>
        </div>

        <div class="kit-row preview-row-v4">
          <span class="kit-tag kit-tag-buy">BUY NOW</span>
          <div class="kit-row-copy">
            <strong>匹克球拍 × 2</strong>
            <small>現在真正需要</small>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="kit-row preview-row-v4">
          <span class="kit-tag kit-tag-reuse">REUSE</span>
          <div class="kit-row-copy">
            <strong>現有羽球鞋</strong>
            <small>合適就繼續用</small>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="kit-row preview-row-v4">
          <span class="kit-tag kit-tag-skip">SKIP</span>
          <div class="kit-row-copy">
            <strong>攜帶式球網</strong>
            <small>目前場景不需要</small>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="preview-spend preview-spend-v4">
          <span>預估起步花費</span>
          <strong>NT$1,900–2,300</strong>
        </div>
      </aside>

      <div class="hero-hand-note">
        <span>Good</span>
        <span>People.</span>
        <span>Better</span>
        <span>Games.</span>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-ball-accent" aria-hidden="true">
        <i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="trust-ribbon trust-ribbon-v3" aria-label="PickleStart 特色">
    <div>
      <span class="trust-icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20 10 10 0 0 0 0-20Zm-3 8 2 2 4-5 2 1.5-5.5 7L7 11.5 9 10Z"/></svg>
      </span>
      <p><strong>專為台灣新手設計</strong><small>在地場地與預算情境</small></p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="trust-icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3 3 7v5c0 5.5 3.8 8.6 9 10 5.2-1.4 9-4.5 9-10V7l-9-4Zm0 4 5 2v3c0 3.7-2.2 5.8-5 6.9C9.2 17.8 7 15.7 7 12V9l5-2Z"/></svg>
      </span>
      <p><strong>依需求整理</strong><small>先看程度、場地與預算</small></p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="trust-icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 4h7c2 0 3.5.7 4 2 .5-1.3 2-2 4-2h3v15h-5c-1.4 0-2 .4-2 1h-2c0-.6-.6-1-2-1H3V4Zm2 2v11h5c1 0 1.7.2 2 .5V8c0-1.4-.8-2-2.5-2H5Zm14 0h-2.5C14.8 6 14 6.6 14 8v9.5c.3-.3 1-.5 2-.5h3V6Z"/></svg>
      </span>
      <p><strong>實用新手指南</strong><small>從 0 開始也不怕</small></p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="trust-icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 3h8v3h3v15H5V6h3V3Zm2 3h4V5h-4v1Zm-2 4v2h8v-2H8Zm0 4v2h8v-2H8Z"/></svg>
      </span>
      <p><strong>規則透明</strong><small>知道為什麼推薦它</small></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-block home-block-v3">
    <div class="section-intro-row">
      <div class="block-heading">
        <p class="section-kicker">HOW IT WORKS</p>
        <h2><span>3 步驟</span>，找到你的起步裝備</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="mini-scribble">
        <strong>簡單 6 題</strong>
        <span>看懂需要買什麼</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flow-grid flow-grid-v3">
      <article class="flow-card">
        <span class="flow-number">01</span>
        <div class="flow-icon detailed-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="17" y="12" width="32" height="42" rx="5" fill="#e8f8fb" stroke="#087fa5" stroke-width="4"/>
            <rect x="25" y="7" width="16" height="10" rx="4" fill="#dff52b" stroke="#10243f" stroke-width="3"/>
            <path d="M24 28h18M24 36h18M24 44h11" stroke="#10243f" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <path d="m13 46 5 5 10-12" fill="none" stroke="#d6ed1f" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>回答 6 個簡單問題</h3>
        <p>告訴我們你的經驗、場地、預算與現有裝備。</p>
      </article>

      <article class="flow-card">
        <span class="flow-number">02</span>
        <div class="flow-icon detailed-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="10" y="36" width="9" height="18" rx="2" fill="#9de5f1"/>
            <rect x="26" y="28" width="9" height="26" rx="2" fill="#54bfd4"/>
            <rect x="42" y="18" width="9" height="36" rx="2" fill="#087fa5"/>
            <path d="m11 28 14-9 10 4 16-14" fill="none" stroke="#10243f" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <path d="M45 9h8v8" fill="none" stroke="#dff52b" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>我們幫你分析需求</h3>
        <p>依預算與需求，整理適合的裝備。</p>
      </article>

      <article class="flow-card">
        <span class="flow-number">03</span>
        <div class="flow-icon detailed-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="17" y="8" width="26" height="32" rx="11" transform="rotate(35 30 24)" fill="#10243f" stroke="#dff52b" stroke-width="3"/>
            <rect x="36" y="34" width="7" height="22" rx="3" transform="rotate(35 39.5 45)" fill="#405667"/>
            <circle cx="49" cy="47" r="10" fill="#dff52b" stroke="#10243f" stroke-width="2"/>
            <g fill="#10243f"><circle cx="46" cy="44" r="1.5"/><circle cx="52" cy="44" r="1.5"/><circle cx="49" cy="50" r="1.5"/></g>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>獲得你的配裝建議</h3>
        <p>分清楚現在買、可以沿用與暫時不用。</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="why-strip why-strip-v3">
    <div class="why-heading">
      <p class="section-kicker">WHY PICKLESTART</p>
      <h2>少買錯裝備<br />更容易開始</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="why-grid">
      <article>
        <span>✓</span>
        <div><strong>只推薦真正需要的</strong><small>不花冤枉錢，從必需品開始</small></div>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span>$</span>
        <div><strong>符合台灣預算與場地</strong><small>考量在地選擇與價格區間</small></div>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span>↗</span>
        <div><strong>新手友善、簡單易懂</strong><small>不用懂器材也能做決定</small></div>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span>◌</span>
        <div><strong>透明推薦邏輯</strong><small>每個建議都有原因</small></div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="guides" class="home-block guide-home-block">
    <div class="block-heading guide-heading-row">
      <div>
        <p class="section-kicker">BEGINNER GUIDES</p>
        <h2>匹克球新手指南</h2>
      </div>
      <a href="/guide" data-home-event="homepage_guide_hub_clicked" data-home-placement="guide_section">看全部新手指南 →</a>
    </div>

    <a class="home-guide-start" href="/guide/what-is-pickleball" data-home-event="homepage_beginner_guide_clicked" data-home-placement="guide_start">
      <div>
        <span>START HERE · 5 MIN</span>
        <strong>第一次接觸匹克球？先看「匹克球到底是什麼」</strong>
        <p>場地、Kitchen、Two-Bounce、常見術語，一篇先建立整體概念。</p>
      </div>
      <b>開始閱讀 →</b>
    </a>

    <div class="visual-guide-grid visual-guide-grid-v3">
      <a class="visual-guide-card" href="/guide/beginner-equipment">
        <img src="/images/guide-equipment.webp" alt="匹克球拍、黃色匹克球與球網" />
        <div class="guide-card-copy">
          <h3>第一次打匹克球要買什麼？</h3>
          <p>從球拍、球到必備裝備，幫你避開新手常見的花費陷阱。</p>
          <span>閱讀指南 →</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a class="visual-guide-card" href="/guide/beginner-budget">
        <img src="/images/guide-budget.webp" alt="匹克球拍、匹克球、鞋子與運動裝備平鋪" />
        <div class="guide-card-copy">
          <h3>匹克球新手預算大概要多少？</h3>
          <p>不同預算下的裝備組合建議，從入門到進階一次看。</p>
          <span>閱讀指南 →</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a class="visual-guide-card" href="/guide/badminton-shoes">
        <img src="/images/guide-shoes.webp" alt="球場邊的白色場地鞋" />
        <div class="guide-card-copy">
          <h3>羽球鞋可以打匹克球嗎？</h3>
          <p>從側向支撐與抓地需求，判斷你現有的鞋能不能先用。</p>
          <span>閱讀指南 →</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="final-sport-cta final-sport-cta-v3">
    <div class="final-court-art" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="net-line"></span>
      <span class="player-silhouette player-one"></span>
      <span class="player-silhouette player-two"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="final-note">Same Game.<br />More Friends.</div>
    <div>
      <p class="section-kicker">READY TO START?</p>
      <h2>從真正需要的裝備開始</h2>
      <p>不用一次買齊，先配出適合這次需求的一套。</p>
    </div>
    <a class="sport-primary" href="/builder?from=home_final" data-home-event="homepage_builder_clicked" data-home-placement="final_cta">
      幫我配第一套裝備 <span>→</span>
    </a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>


<script>
  import { trackEvent } from "../lib/analytics";

  document
    .querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>("[data-home-event]")
    .forEach((element) => {
      element.addEventListener("click", () => {
        const name = element.dataset.homeEvent;

        if (!name) return;

        trackEvent(name, {
          placement: element.dataset.homePlacement ?? "unknown"
        });
      });
    });
</script>

